  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Debt Management III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skuldhantering III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att bidra till en h&#xe5;llbar skuldhantering och d&#xe4;rmed en f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad ekonomisk situation i Moldavien. Projektet avser utveckla expertis inom skuldhantering p&#xe5; finansmionisteriet och medverka till att Moldavien f&#xe5;r tillg&#xe5;ng till den internationella finansmarknaden. Detta f&#xf6;r att Moldavien ska bli en kreditv&#xe4;rdig l&#xe5;ntagare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to facilitate a sustainable debt management and thus improve the econimic situation in Moldova. The project will develop expertise within the Ministry of Finance for sustainable debt management and enable access to the international fiancial market to ensure Moldova&apos;s international credit ratings.</narrative>
  </description>
